    "summary": "The user asks for a comparison of travel stability in Caracas, specifically questioning whether the current government acts as a stabilizing force or if opposition-led unrest is the primary driver of chaos. The assistant repeatedly redirects the conversation away from political causality, focusing instead on the constant threat of organized crime regardless of the political actor in power.",
